attributes.Rune_C#Wizard_EnergyTwister:
{c_gold}Trail of Destruction{/c_gold}
Casting Energy Twister grants you a Wind Charge. You can store up to {c_green}{Script Formula 9}{/c_green} Wind Charges at a time. Casting a Signature spell releases all Wind Charges as a giant Energy Twister that deals {c_green}[{Script Formula 5} * 100]%{/c_green} weapon damage as Arcane per Wind Charge.

Signature spells are: Magic Missile, Shock Pulse, Spectral Blade, Electrocute

attributes.Rune_C#Witchdoctor_PlagueOfToads:
{c_gold}Toad of Hugeness{/c_gold}
Summon a giant toad that swallows enemies whole for up to {c_green}{Script Formula 23}{/c_green} seconds, digesting for {c_green}[{Script formula 14} * 100]%{/c_green} of your weapon damage per second as Physical.

This rune adds a {c_green}{Script Formula 23}{/c_green} second cooldown to the skill.

attributes.Rune_B#Witchdoctor_CorpseSpider:
{c_gold}Spider Queen{/c_gold}
Summon a mother spider that births spiderlings dealing {c_green}[{Script Formula 14} * 100]%{/c_green} weapon damage per second as Poison to enemies in the area.  Lasts {c_green}{Script Formula 10}{/c_green} seconds.

You may only have one mother spider summoned at a time.

attributes.Rune_C#DemonHunter_EntanglingShot:
{c_gold}Chain Lighting {/c_gold}
Strike targets with Electrified chains.
Strike targets with electrical chains that do an additional {c_green}[(({Script Formula 8} * {Script Formula 13}) / {Script Formula 4}) * 100]%{/c_green} weapon damage per second as Lightning for {c_green}{Script Formula 4}{/c_green} seconds.

attributes.Rune_E#Monk_MantraOfEvasion:
{c_gold}Divine Protection{/c_gold}
When you or an ally under the effect of Mantra of Evasion is reduced below {c_green}[{Script Formula 10}*100]%{/c_green} Life, a shield of protection forms around that target, reducing incoming damage by {c_green}[{Script Formula 9}*100]%{/c_green} for {c_green}{Script Formula 7}{/c_green} seconds. 

Each target can be protected at most once every {c_green}[{Script Formula 8}]{/c_green} seconds by this effect.

